          "end": 5.28,
          "en": "And that's it for this course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.28,
          "end": 9.18,
          "en": "We repeated the essentials about which you already learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.18,
          "end": 11.1,
          "en": "in the previous course section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.1,
          "end": 13.5,
          "en": "the Remix Essentials course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.5,
          "end": 16.833,
          "en": "But we also learned about many new features.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.73,
          "end": 21.6,
          "en": "We learned about this Layout Route feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.6,
          "end": 24.51,
          "en": "where you have nested routes and folders,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.51,
          "end": 27.45,
          "en": "and then file names with the same names as folders",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.45,
          "end": 30.63,
          "en": "so that you can render the content of one route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.63,
          "end": 33.39,
          "en": "nested inside of another route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.39,
          "end": 35.97,
          "en": "You also learned about pathless layout routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.97,
          "end": 39.72,
          "en": "which is the same feature, but without adding a new path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.72,
          "end": 41.58,
          "en": "And you learned how that could, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.58,
          "end": 45.69,
          "en": "be used to share some styles across related routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.69,
          "end": 48.93,
          "en": "You learned about Splat Routes and Resource Routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.93,
          "end": 51.888,
          "en": "and about all these different kinds of routes in general.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.888,
          "end": 54.75,
          "en": "And of course, we also practiced linking",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.75,
          "end": 56.64,
          "en": "between all these different routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.64,
          "end": 59.07,
          "en": "You learned about relative links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.07,
          "end": 60.753,
          "en": "for this cancel button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.8,
          "end": 64.59,
          "en": "You learned about programmatic navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.59,
          "end": 65.853,
          "en": "as we're doing it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.84,
          "end": 70.11,
          "en": "And you learned about this Search Params feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.11,
          "end": 74.85,
          "en": "which can be used to store some state in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.85,
          "end": 76.41,
          "en": "in the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.41,
          "end": 78.21000000000001,
          "en": "And you learned how that can be used to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.21000000000001,
          "end": 80.55,
          "en": "build a user interface where one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.55,
          "end": 83.34,
          "en": "at the same page can be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
